Upon further consideration, influenced by on Ralph's feedback in https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36496#issuecomment-610179; it may be safer to revert my suggestion and instead opt for adding `Assume(m_tasks.capacity() >= std::min(workers_count, m_inputs.size()))` with an explanatory comment like so:

